msgctxt "3\t195"
msgid "In December of 2005,\\\\nI lost someone very important to me."
msgstr "Nel dicembre del 2005,\\\\nho perso qualcuno che mi era molto caro."

msgctxt "226\t301"
msgid "Looking back..."
msgstr "Ripensandoci..."

msgctxt "316\t432"
msgid "...maybe that was when our fates had\\\\nbeen sealed."
msgstr "...forse fu allora che il nostro destino\\\\nfu segnato."

msgctxt "605\t721"
msgid "Back when I was still in the Dojima Family\\\\n⑬a branch of the Tojo Clan⑬"
msgstr "Quando facevo ancora parte della Famiglia Dojima,\\\\n⑬una costola del Clan Tojo⑬"

msgctxt "737\t861"
msgid "⑬there were only three people in the\\\\nworld that I considered family."
msgstr "⑬c'erano solo tre persone al mondo\\\\nche consideravo famiglia."

msgctxt "939\t1082"
msgid ""
"My best friend, Akira Nishiki, who grew\\\\nup in the same orphanage as me."
msgstr ""
"Il mio migliore amico, Akira Nishiki,\\\\ncresciuto con me nello stesso orfanotrofio."

msgctxt "1175\t1381"
msgid "My foster father, Shintaro Fuma."
msgstr "Il mio padre adottivo, Shintaro Fuma."

msgctxt "1439\t1654"
msgid "And lastly, Yumi⑬the woman I had\\\\nloved since childhood."
msgstr "E infine, Yumi⑬la donna che amavo\\\\nfin da bambino."

msgctxt "1690\t1790"
msgid "Having lost my parents at a young age,\\\\nthese three..."
msgstr "Avendo perso i miei genitori da piccolo,\\\\nquesti tre..."

msgctxt "1800\t1914"
msgid "...were the only ones I could really\\\\ncall \"family.\""
msgstr "...erano gli unici che potevo davvero\\\\nchiamare \"famiglia\"."

msgctxt "2074\t2099"
msgid "However..."
msgstr "Però..."

msgctxt "2550\t2713"
msgid "What've I done!?\\\\nHe's one of the Tojo Clan's officers!"
msgstr "Cosa ho fatto!?\\\\nÈ uno degli ufficiali del Clan Tojo!"

msgctxt "2738\t2904"
msgid ""
"Lying in front of me was the corpse of\\\\nthe patriarch of the Dojima Family."
msgstr ""
"Davanti a me giaceva il cadavere\\\\ndel patriarca della Famiglia Dojima."

msgctxt "2943\t3110"
msgid "He had tried to force himself on Yumi."
msgstr "Aveva cercato di approfittarsi di Yumi."

msgctxt "3120\t3168"
msgid "Snap out of it!"
msgstr "Riprenditi!"

msgctxt "3204\t3279"
msgid "Nishiki...\\\\nTake Yumi and get out of here."
msgstr "Nishiki...\\\\nPrendi Yumi e andatevene."

msgctxt "3294\t3355"
msgid "But... What about you?"
msgstr "Ma... e tu?"

msgctxt "3408\t3563"
msgid "Just go. And take care of Yumi!"
msgstr "Vai. E prenditi cura di Yumi!"

msgctxt "3609\t3633"
msgid "Go!"
msgstr "Vai!"

msgctxt "3836\t3906"
msgid "I was prepared to do anything..."
msgstr "Ero pronto a fare qualsiasi cosa..."

msgctxt "3989\t4067"
msgid "...to protect the ones I loved."
msgstr "...pur di proteggere chi amavo."

msgctxt "4169\t4215"
msgid "Start eating!"
msgstr "Mangiate!"

msgctxt "4301\t4349"
msgid "I was sentenced to ten years."
msgstr "Fui condannato a dieci anni."

msgctxt "4393\t4509"
msgid ""
"After going inside, I got a letter of\\\\nexpulsion from the Dojima Family..."
msgstr ""
"Una volta dentro, ricevetti una lettera\\\\ndi espulsione dalla Famiglia Dojima..."

msgctxt "4529\t4628"
msgid "...and found out that Yumi had disappeared."
msgstr "...e scoprii che Yumi era sparita."

msgctxt "4656\t4759"
msgid "I was branded as the traitor who capped\\\\nhis own boss."
msgstr "Fui bollato come il traditore\\\\nche aveva ammazzato il proprio capo."

msgctxt "4782\t4932"
msgid ""
"The organization had abandoned me,\\\\nand I began to slowly retreat into "
"myself."
msgstr ""
"L'organizzazione mi aveva abbandonato\\\\ne cominciai lentamente a chiudermi in me stesso."

msgctxt "4940\t5078"
msgid "But there was one person who never forgot me."
msgstr "Ma c'era una persona che non mi aveva mai dimenticato."

msgctxt "5120\t5155"
msgid "Pop..."
msgstr "Papà..."

msgctxt "5208\t5282"
msgid "My foster father, Shintaro Fuma."
msgstr "Il mio padre adottivo, Shintaro Fuma."

msgctxt "5330\t5433"
msgid "After my release, I returned to Kamurocho."
msgstr "Dopo la scarcerazione, tornai a Kamurocho."

msgctxt "5439\t5518"
msgid "I had to see my father."
msgstr "Dovevo vedere mio padre."

msgctxt "5519\t5699"
msgid "And I also wanted to find out what had\\\\nhappened in the last ten years."
msgstr "E volevo anche scoprire cosa era successo\\\\nnegli ultimi dieci anni."

msgctxt "5755\t5851"
msgid "But I wasn't prepared for what awaited\\\\nme there..."
msgstr "Ma non ero pronto per quello che\\\\nmi aspettava là..."

msgctxt "5875\t6015"
msgid "I have something to ask the Third\\\\nChairman in front of everyone."
msgstr "Ho qualcosa da chiedere al Terzo Presidente\\\\ndi fronte a tutti."

msgctxt "6056\t6273"
msgid "Is it true that 10 billion yen of the\\\\nclan's money has been stolen?"
msgstr "È vero che 10 miliardi di yen\\\\ndel clan sono stati rubati?"

msgctxt "6334\t6405"
msgid "My former best friend, now changed..."
msgstr "Il mio ex migliore amico, ormai cambiato..."

msgctxt "6454\t6596"
msgid "...and a group of hardened killers\\\\nsearching for missing money."
msgstr "...e un gruppo di killer incalliti\\\\nalla ricerca del denaro scomparso."

msgctxt "6730\t6763"
msgid "Pop!"
msgstr "Papà!"

msgctxt "6801\t6882"
msgid "There was a sudden struggle to\\\\ndecide the Tojo Clan's successor."
msgstr "Scoppiò un'improvvisa lotta\\\\nper decidere il successore del Clan Tojo."

msgctxt "6929\t7076"
msgid "And I found myself right in the middle of it."
msgstr "E mi ritrovai proprio nel mezzo di tutto ciò."

msgctxt "7301\t7512"
msgid ""
"I looked for Yumi, taking my father's word\\\\nthat she was connected to the "
"money."
msgstr ""
"Cercai Yumi, fidandomi della parola di mio padre:\\\\nera legata al denaro scomparso."

msgctxt "7527\t7554"
msgid "However..."
msgstr "Però..."

msgctxt "7728\t7775"
msgid "...instead of Yumi..."
msgstr "...al posto di Yumi..."

msgctxt "7825\t7883"
msgid "...I found a young girl."
msgstr "...trovai una bambina."
